:"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256763597/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1580304680","hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1095120/245954/d97963476b18152ce05ba7149d966c8824a683ab/1751187759/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1580304680","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/256763597/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Steam Cloud","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":true},"controller":"full","dev":["Perfectly Paranormal"],"pub":["Yogscast Games"],"released":"Aug 18, 2020","meta":null,"langs":["English","German","Norwegian","Russian","Simplified Chinese","French","Turkish","Spanish - Spain"],"min":[["OS","Windows 7 SP1+"],["Processor","SSE2 instruction set support."],["Memory","4 GB RAM"],["Graphics","Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities. 2GB VRAM."],["DirectX","Version 10"],["Storage","1500 MB available space"]],"rec":[],"deck":2,"blurb":"Death arrives early for Bj\u00f8rn, a Viking who refuses to fight, in this narrative adventure with puzzle-platforming. After landing in Valhalla he is revived to help the mysterious Pesto retrieve a magical item. His undying body can detach and recombine its limbs at will, and you use that ability to solve puzzles and cross tricky levels.\n\nHelheim Hassle shares a universe with Manual Samuel and takes a macabre approach, with friendship as a recurring theme alongside the body parts. Single-player with full controller support, it suits players who like quirky puzzle platformers with a dark sense of humor."}}